<title>MEXICO: Mexico budget proposals to Congress on Nov 7.</title>
<headline>Mexico budget proposals to Congress on Nov 7.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's Finance Ministry will submit its 1997 budget proposals to Congress on Thursday, November 7, a Ministry spokesman told Reuters on Monday.</p>
<p>The spokesman said the bill would be presented Thursday, and that Finance Minister Guillermo Ortiz was due to attend a hearing in Congress one week later, although the exact date had yet to be confirmed.</p>
<p>-- Cecilia Cardenas, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9552</p>
</text>
